  "description": "PostgreSQL persistence for Lyo.Authentication. Provides EF Core stores for opaque API tokens (`[user].[token]`), Lyo users (`[user].[user]`), linked external identities (`[user].[linked_identity]`), extra JWT claims (`[user].[claim]`), and authorization scopes (`[user].[scope]`). Schema-owning library — owns the `[user]` schema and the `__EFMigrationsHistory` table inside it.",
